00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.300
Only one force can stop this evil.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.220
A handful of brave men.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.440
In specially created exo-frames, they can be transported anywhere

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.540
to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.100
Beam down from the space station Sky Vault,

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.450
becoming man and machine power extreme.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.460
Max Ray, Brilliant Sea Operations Commander.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.440
Jake Rockwell, Rugged Land Operations Specialist.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.800
Ace McLeod, Daring Air Operations Expert.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:54.190
Whatever the challenge, they are ready.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:55.990
The Centurion!

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:19.580
They'll think we're after the plutonium, but all Doc Terra wants is to keep the Centurions busy.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.180
It should be a breeze.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:22.950
Troops, attack!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.390
Let them get the plutonium.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:40.010
We need the centurion.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:49.440
Good day, Max.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.980
Afternoon. Got anything interesting?

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:54.370
Try the second shelf in the back.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:01:59.960
Identify...

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:11.320
